        <briefdescription>
<para>Run Map-Reduce RAG. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Splits <computeroutput>documents</computeroutput> into token-budget-sized batches, calls <computeroutput>infer</computeroutput> once per batch, then calls <computeroutput>infer</computeroutput> once more to synthesise the final answer from the partial results.</para>
<para>If all documents fit in a single context window the single-pass path is taken and <ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_multi_step_r_a_g_result_1a9afb8857a7b086be3a745127a7028d0d" kindref="member">MultiStepRAGResult::context_overflow</ref> is false.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Original user query. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>documents</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>All retrieved candidate documents. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>infer</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>LLM inference callback. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_multi_step_r_a_g_result" kindref="compound">MultiStepRAGResult</ref> with final_answer and step details. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
